<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Foodland year net falls 10.1 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Foodland year net falls 10.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to July 28</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     47.3 vs 52.6</p>
<p>NOTE: Foodland Associated Ltd is a food retailer and wholesaler. Company said it plans to buy back up to 10 percent of its shares.  </p>
<p>NOTE - Operating profit before tax for geographic segments</p>
<p>    Australia				56.2 vs 51.3</p>
<p>    New Zealand			    71.2 vs 85.0</p>
<p>Revenue (in A$ billion)</p>
<p>    Australia				1.07 vs 1.02</p>
<p>    New Zealand			    2.62 vs 2.57</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
